WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.150
A convincing answer is not the same as a verified answer.

2
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.800
Read the claim without assuming it is accurate.

3
00:00:08.752 --> 00:00:11.752
Compare it with a separate, inspectable record.

4
00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:16.628
Decide what the evidence supports and what remains uncertain.
